  "evidencia": "Page: Eme 15. Sentence: Eme 15 (also stylized as \"EME XV\" and \"M-15\") were a Mexican Latin pop band composed of the six lead actors from the 2012 Nickelodeon Latin America television series \"Miss XV\".\nPage: Miss XV. Sentence: Miss XV (sometimes stylized as \"Miss 15\") is a Mexican teen musical television series, it was inspired by the 1987 telenovela \"Quinceañera\".\nPage: Jack Duarte. Sentence: He is known for his acting performance in the Mexican telenovela \"Rebelde\" as \"Tomas Goycolea\"\" and as a member of the Mexican-Argentine pop band, \"Eme 15\".",
