        "original_id": "087ee948-9ec5-51f8-b777-b350681d2c82",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jack Duarte\n- Bands: Eme 15\n- Television series: Miss XV, Rebelde\n- Telenovelas: Quinceañera\n\nFacts:\n- Quinceañera is a 1987 telenovela that inspired the Mexican teen musical television series Miss XV.\n- Miss XV is a Mexican teen musical television series and is sometimes stylized as Miss 15.\n- Eme 15 was a Mexican Latin pop band composed of the six lead actors from the 2012 Nickelodeon Latin America television series Miss XV.\n- Eme 15 was also stylized as EME XV and M-15.\n- Jack Duarte is known for playing Tomas Goycolea in the Mexican telenovela Rebelde.\n- Jack Duarte was a member of the Mexican-Argentine pop band Eme 15.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "b229fe13-b025-56b1-8d22-cc2c177ac5db",
        "text": "Page: Eme 15. Sentence: Eme 15 (also stylized as \"EME XV\" and \"M-15\") were a Mexican Latin pop band composed of the six lead actors from the 2012 Nickelodeon Latin America television series \"Miss XV\".\nPage: Miss XV. Sentence: Miss XV (sometimes stylized as \"Miss 15\") is a Mexican teen musical television series, it was inspired by the 1987 telenovela \"Quinceañera\".\nPage: Jack Duarte. Sentence: He is known for his acting performance in the Mexican telenovela \"Rebelde\" as \"Tomas Goycolea\"\" and as a member of the Mexican-Argentine pop band, \"Eme 15\".",
